The Curious Area Workshop
   The C.A.W. Builders' Handbook is available as a single zipped file for
download. If you wish to distribute this file, please let me know and
do not remove or add any files to the archive without my prior consent.

This tar file should contain the following eight files:

README          - This file
BhndBk-2.2      - The main document on building areas for DikuMUDs
Appendix.1      - A reference set of all the charts used in BhndBk-2.2
Handbook.mob    - An example .mob file
Handbook.obj    - An example .obj file
Handbook.shp    - An example .shp file
Handbook.wld    - An example .wld file
Handbook.zon    - An example .zon file

Furry
C.A.W.
06/19/96
